        "id": 229520,
        "name": "Leffa",
        "username": "Leffa",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/df705f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2020-01-02T18:13:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sorry it has taken me some time to reply. Work and such has been busy.</p>\n<p>I have looked at a few alternatives, and <a href=\"https://www.rolegate.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Role Gate</a> looks the most promising to me. If anyone has any objections, let me know. If not, I'll create a game tomorrow and send you all the password to join.</p>\n<p>I was thinking to set it in a fictional west coast city, that could look like any west coast city. The name in my head right now is Santa Luna, though I'm not set on the name yet.</p>\n<p>Hoping to finish up the last few details this weekend so we can start next week.</p>\n<p>The sheet looks good ErekLich. It will be helpful.</p>",
